# Layers 1 to 5 come before layer 6 (CR 613.1, 613.6): Painter's Servant's "All cards that aren't on the battlefield, spells,
# and permanents are the chosen color in addition to their other colors" is a layer-5 effect, applied before Eaten by Piranhas
# takes its abilities away in layer 6, so it still paints everything green - Bot1's Island and Mox, Bot2's Island. The Servant
# itself is black only: the Aura's "is black" is layer 5 too, later in timestamp order, and sets its color.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Eaten by Piranhas
Island
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Painter's Servant
Island
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Painter's Servant.Cast
Bot2.Colors(Green)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Colors = Green
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eaten by Piranhas.Cast(Painter's Servant)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Painter's Servant.Colors = Black
Bot2.Battlefield.Painter's Servant.Subtypes = Skeleton
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Colors = Green
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Colors = Green
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Colors = Green
Bot1.Battlefield.Eaten by Piranhas.Colors = Blue; Green
